1000
01:22:27,600 --> 01:22:32,960
[SPEAKER_02] And I think this gets at the key point I want to make with promotions because promotions are not rocket science, right?

1001
01:22:33,280 --> 01:22:34,880
[SPEAKER_02] It's a tool, just like a lot of these things are.

1002
01:22:35,040 --> 01:22:44,000
[SPEAKER_02] It's a tool to better align the value of your product with the willingness to pay of an individual customer and by doing so to capture more consumer surplus for your business.

1003
01:22:44,480 --> 01:22:46,880
[SPEAKER_02] The key though is you have to be targeted and thoughtful about it.

1004
01:22:47,040 --> 01:22:53,280
[SPEAKER_02] And so I actually think we've got a good little bit of an over rotation on the amount of act now black Friday deals.

1005
