1009
01:23:11,760 --> 01:23:22,960
[SPEAKER_02] So if a user comes in and they don't subscribe within their first 24 hours, look at the point where 90% of your subscribers typically convert, and then whatever that time period is at that point, if a user hasn't converted, offer them a discount.

1010
01:23:23,280 --> 01:23:30,160
[SPEAKER_02] I think that's a really effective method because the user is giving you a direct signal on their level of intent willingness to pay based off of their activity in the app.

1011
01:23:30,400 --> 01:23:31,120
[SPEAKER_02] So that's a good one.

1012
01:23:31,440 --> 01:23:44,560
